WEBVTT

00:03:58.000 --> 00:04:00.000
takes our tool

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:03.000
and, every day, drags in images and text.

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:06.000
CA: So you want to license this software to publishers

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:08.000
